# Raw game logs stay on the local machine: they carry local paths and the
# command line, and they can be regenerated only by rerunning the game.
# The repository keeps the derived, path-free report/ outputs instead.
# Archived copies (with sha256 manifest) live in the private repo letheli710/HSD-RawData (D-76):
# apex/ for the runs copied via _archive, apex-early/ for the 10-20..10-24 runs (MANIFEST-EARLY.tsv).
data/**/platform/
data/**/scriptdump_*
# Unified per-row table (several MB per session); rebuilt from the raw logs by hsd_tel.py report.
data/**/report/rows.csv
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Exports that failed the strict hsdmove-trial/2 check (kept locally as evidence, not replayed)
m4/trials/*_REJECTED/
